       above every other carry: continue 14 and start 10, against medicine 13/9,
       construction 12/8 and bills 11/7. Still under Core's HaulGeneral (15), because food
       already on this side being put away properly still comes first.

       Patient feeding is a deployment in Doctor, placed against Core's own feeding givers
