       humanlikes, so a feeder partway to a gate is not turned around by a patient who needs
       a meal at home, and still below tending (100) and emergency tending (110), which must
       always win over feeding. Starting sits at 4, below every Core doctor giver and below
       the cross-gate tending start at 5, because a patient who needs treatment is more
       urgent than one who needs a meal.

       Balance decisions, recorded as such, and player-tunable while the game runs. -->

